  "body_html": "<h1>decisive_spread</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem decisive_spread [Fintype N] [Fintype A] {F : SWF N A} (hU : SWF.Unanimity F) (hIIA : SWF.IIA F) {C : Set N} {x y z : A} (hxy : x ≠ y) (hxz : x ≠ z) (hyz : y ≠ z) (hC : Set.Nonempty C) (h : IsWeaklyDecisiveFor F C x y) : IsDecisive F C</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>SWF</li>\n<li>Unanimity</li>\n<li>IIA</li>\n<li>IsWeaklyDecisiveFor</li>\n<li>IsDecisive</li>\n<li>isWeaklyDecisiveFor_of_isDecisiveFor</li>\n<li>IsPositiveAffineOf.symm</li>\n<li>Indifferent.symm</li>\n</ul>",
